  <!--
    Icons - the theme's single icon vocabulary. HAND-AUTHORED (library-owned).

    All theme iconography is sourced from Google Material Symbols (Outlined, weight 400,
    grade 0, optical size 24; viewBox 0 -960 960 960). Material Symbols is the authentic
    Material 3 icon set, so it keeps the desktop theme consistent with Android/M3.
    Licensed Apache-2.0 (c) Google - see THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES/MATERIAL-SYMBOLS-LICENSE.txt
    (repo: Assets/Icons/MATERIAL-SYMBOLS-LICENSE.txt).

    Do NOT introduce glyphs from other icon sets (Phosphor, etc.) unless Material Symbols
    genuinely lacks the glyph - document the exception here if so. Add icons as the theme
    needs them rather than bundling the whole set.

    Keys are uniquely prefixed Material_Icon* so consuming apps never collide with these
    resources and can opt in to OVERRIDE a glyph by redefining the same key downstream
    (control themes reference them via {DynamicResource}). Reference from a Path with
    Stretch="Uniform" + Fill (these are filled single-color paths, not strokes).
  -->

